      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹33.32 (up from ₹25.89 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹55.3b (up 22% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹6.26b (up 29% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 4.8% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 24% growth forecast for the Consumer Finance industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 22% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 42% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
